category: Net
requires: cygwin
sdesc: "Recursive DNS/DNSCurve server and comandline tool to debug DNS/DNSCurve"
ldesc: "Dq is a package with DNS/DNSCurve related software. It contains a recursive
DNS server with DNSCurve support called dqcache and also a commandline tool to
debug DNS/DNScurve called dq."

